    {
      "q": "A rectangular garden has area (6x + 9) square units. Factorise this to find a common dimension.",
      "a": "Find the common factor of 6x and 9.\nBoth are divisible by 3.\n6x + 9 = 3(2x + 3)\n\nSo one dimension can be 3 units and the other (2x + 3) units. ✅",
